# Docker context allowlist for deploy/hosted/Dockerfile (context = repo root).
# Only the prebuilt bundle, the python helpers and the OCR language data enter
# the image.
#
# This is an ALLOWLIST: anything the Dockerfile COPYs must be un-ignored here as
# well, or the build dies with "file not found in build context" — which reads
# like a missing file rather than an ignore rule. test/hosted-image.test.ts
# checks the two stay in step.
*
!python/
!tessdata/
!deploy/hosted/build/handler.mjs
